418002:0":{"text":"それは決して楽な道のりではない。忍耐と勇気、そして知恵が試される試練の旅なのだ。","source_cn":"但寻宝之旅并不是轻松的旅途，而是对耐心、勇气、智慧的考验。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CB009C445C3525F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1534418003:0":{"text":"今回は、今まさに宝探しの旅に出ようとしている一人の勇士の物語……","source_cn":"这次故事的主角，就是一个即将踏上寻宝之旅的勇士……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB8F46008274E3A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:老兽人暗眼":{"text":"獣人のダルカイ","source":"老兽人暗眼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep5/env_story/15344185.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15344185","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15344185","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1534418501:0":{"text":"どうやら長い話になりそうだ……でも、もう少しだけ聞いてみようかな。","source_cn":"好像是个很长的故事……或许可以再继续往下听听看？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB01C1D3CDC3F97A4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"どうやら長い話になりそうだ……でも、もう少しだけ聞いてみようかな。","female":"どうやら長い話になりそうね……でも、もう少しだけ聞いてみようかしら。","variant_male_record_index":"189477","variant_female_record_index":"189478","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:主角":{"text":"主人公","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep5/env_story/15344190.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15344190","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15344190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1534419001:0":{"text":"勇士は自らの宝がどこにあるのかを知らない。だが、最初の一歩を踏み出すことが、そこへ至る唯一の道であることを知っている。","source_cn":"勇士并不知道自己的宝藏究竟在何处。但勇士知道，只有迈出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C8D8CE63EEF6B70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1534419002:0":{"text":"親友たちの祝福を胸に、勇士は荷物を背負い、外に広がる森へと足を踏み入れた。彼女は常人ならとうに諦めるような長い時間を、ひたむきに手がかりを探し続けた。","source_cn":"带着亲友的祝福，勇士背着行囊，踏入了部落外的密林。她找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B993266FA9CA6D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1534419003:0":{"text":"勇士の忍耐はついに報われた。それはこれまで見たことのない小川で、彼女を未知の世界へ導こうとしていた……","source_cn":"勇士的耐心得到了回报。她找到了一条从未见过的溪流，要将...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0513CBEBE92E877D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:老兽人暗眼":{"text":"獣人のダルカイ","source":"老兽人暗眼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep5/env_story/15344195.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15344195","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15344195","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1534419501:0":{"text":"もうすぐクライマックスだな……これなら最後まで聞けるかも。","source_cn":"很快就是大结局了……或许可以继续把故事听完？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x24E2E24B990C8F74","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"もうすぐクライマックスだな……これなら最後まで聞けるかも。","female":"もうすぐクライマックスね……これなら最後まで聞けるかも。","variant_male_record_index":"189482","variant_female_record_index":"189483","document_title":"","document_